      "name": "Contingency Contract",
      "level": "",
      "desc": "- The operation comprises 4 consecutive enemy waves to fight. Defeat all enemy waves to complete the operation.\n- Healing Masses will be dropped between the waves. Touch them to restore HP to every teammate.\n- There is a resting session between waves, during which the operators are still considered to be in battle.\n- The operation has a countdown timer. Once the timer ends or all operators in the team are reduced to ZERO HP, the operation is interrupted.\n- Tacticals and consumables cannot be used.",
